  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lesotho New Hospital PPP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective for the $6.25 million in GPOBA funds is to support the Lesotho Public-Private Partnership for the national referral hospital by expanding the number and types of key services available to patients and acting as a top-up payment to allow additional volume for critical services.</narrative>
