      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual value="24247.00">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since its opening on October 1, 2011, &#x2018;&#x2019;the Queen Mamohato Memorial Hospital&#x201d; (QMM) has consistently exceeded its key targets formonthly inpatients volume.  Year-to-Date (YTD) in-patient admission number from October 1, 2011 to September 30, 2012 exceeded theannual admission target under the PPP Agreement by approximately 47% (24,247 compared to the annual admission target of 16,500).</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
